      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `01371d903392b0914dd733abecf6aa24adbf805d0db2a8f1a7b931bffc3f08ff--45130do007_200809.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008-09\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7c372ae74c2bcb9aaf6a23ef8da2d68ba772a0b1de5d4256eb9acb2fa7b0a63f | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | c8bced507e6bee6f1b16d19034a32f3d0db1f1ec410b4146563fcd57c5cb6196 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 8a99bb72742b385b1c52f9cb84a4a60d67059b4cde959dda05f0cfd12170fd47 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | e2204303f4bfdcaff6fddff2bd48e2f674e4761ccb3a520fbf34fe7708d2331a | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | e52567f8fb714910c6952654b6f8c1a780e099c9852f9e7d11005d275d9bc3ae | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | b8b2da5b527782b8676420013a8a646943ce3d541586e990fe9e7b59a5ba2b0d | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 71b1eddf4e46754750f2fbdd7f69ed4dd8c39bf10d6a512551d3829de2b36b1b | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 5b93b3bdf4616cb6372a77186094c11f50fbbb07c7d39c9e7266849af0341783 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 45b72e2b11a7872f4aad5c1ce89444394793e8534d3b091b4cd879c9f647f622 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 33a33604653b523d17a30188172165fb41b1ebe6e4aac20dbbca0fa025d87d09 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 65c3be0cf4729f8b04d3d5bf75f860b25301a674c68f61c2323d787dfabb321a | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 5a8c59c9e612e53c5f28b7a0e0ae58f8c20882a658f514488269537fb3b955ea | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 43262555b5ef94dd7fd2a671dc816c86fa90367a8f27df30c73c1df49ebb4b49 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 9add7710bec699d220babc358b28d27af37f9e5ec7100d65a6e004ab1c0ea1c9 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | df50bee0946d045e62124a6d2b0ff0af5b0ff1a9a9098745777eb38e757e348b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and che